      </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          ，\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          像我们\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这几个月经常喝的黄皮茉莉\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          气泡饮料里风味特征，所以我们在风味描述里破天荒的把黄皮，这一个今年在进入我们视线的\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          风味词加了进来。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;font-size: 14px;\">\n          更多咖啡信请查询公众号文章板块～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px;padding: 0px;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;\">\n          淘宝和有赞小程序可选购更多豆豆哈\n          <br style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin: 0px 0px 0em;padding: 0px;clear: both;min-height: 1em;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: mp-quote, -apple-system-font, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 17px;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;letter-spacing: normal;orphans: 2;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;white-space: normal;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png\" style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;max-width: 100%;height: auto !important;vertical-align: bottom;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n</div>",
